          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0261",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "看到“分析某个产品设计”的题，按这个框架答，分点分条，老师按点给分     ：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0262",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "1. 功能 ：这个产品能干什么……",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0263",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "2. 形态 ：它长什么样，为什么长这样……",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0264",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "3. 人机 ：人怎么用它，哪里握着舒服……",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0265",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "4. 材料/工艺 ：用什么做的，怎么造出来……",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0266",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "5. 可持续 ：环保方面怎么考虑的……",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0267",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "二、建模类简答题万能模板",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0268",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "看到“怎么做某个造型/纹理”的题：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0269",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "1. 先建主体曲面（用什么命令）",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0270",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "2. 再处理细节（布尔差集开孔/倒角/分件）",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0271",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "3. 最后做纹理或特征（沿曲面流动/阵列/投影）",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0272",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "4. 质量检测（斑马纹检查G2连续性）",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0273",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "三、渲染类简答题万能模板",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
