      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0274",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "看到“怎么表现某种材质”的题：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0275",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "1. 选什么材质类型（塑料/金属/玻璃/半透明）",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0276",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "2. 调什么参数（漫反射颜色/粗糙度/IOR/凹凸贴图）",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0277",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "3. 打什么光（区域光柔和/针状光锐利/HDR环境）",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0278",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "4. 加什么特效（AO/贴图通道/体积光）",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
